@page "/categories"

<PageTitle>Categories</PageTitle>

<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
    <div>
        <h1>Categories</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Manage standard categories used by master and client rules.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" disabled>Add Category</button>
</div>

<div class="alert alert-info">
    Use a colon to separate a main category and subcategory. Example:
    <strong>Auto:Insurance</strong> means <strong>Auto</strong> is the main category and <strong>Insurance</strong> is the subcategory.
</div>

<div class="card"><div class="card-body">
    <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Category management will be database-backed in the next milestone.</p>
</div></div>
